The SVG files in this directory are Lucide icons (https://lucide.dev), taken
from the `lucide-react` package at v1.25.0 and rewritten as standalone
documents: one 24x24 viewBox, stroke 2, round caps and joins. Nothing else was
changed, and the paths are Lucide's.

Only icons with a call site in this window are here. An icon that stops being
drawn is deleted from this directory and from `kit/src/ui/icon.rs`, so the set
never becomes a gallery.

