Some Lucide icons derive from Feather (MIT, Copyright (c) 2013-present Cole
Bemis). Of the set here, that covers: arrow-up, at-sign, check, chevron-down,
chevron-right, copy, corner-down-left, folder, git-branch, info, moon, paperclip,
plus, search, square, sun, terminal, triangle-alert, type, x.
